(# Cozy Comfort - Task 3, 4 and 5 Answers) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 3\) Testing Scope and Coverage \(LO3\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### 3.1 Testing strategy used) Tj
T* (- **Unit-level checks** for service/repository rules \(status transitions, inventory update guards, role constraints\).) Tj
T* (- **API-level validation** for endpoint payloads and expected response behavior \(`200`, `400`, `404`\).) Tj
T* (- **Workflow testing** for end-to-end request lifecycle:) Tj
T* (  1. Seller creates request.) Tj
T* (  2. Distributor fulfills/escalates.) Tj
T* (  3. Manufacturer dispatches when applicable.) Tj
T* (  4. Receiver confirms delivery.) Tj
T* (  5. Inventory updates after receive.) Tj
T* (- **Regression testing** for previously reported failures \(signup + missing `Email` column, invalid order transitions\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### 3.2 Debugging evidence to demonstrate) Tj
T* (- Reproduce issue with known input.) Tj
T* (- Capture logs/stack trace and identify failing module.) Tj
T* (- Apply fix in isolated layer \(service/repository/controller\).) Tj
T* (- Retest the same scenario + edge cases.) Tj
T* (- Record before/after behavior.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### 3.3 Suggested test cases table) Tj
T* (1. Signup on legacy DB without `Users.Email` column -> should not crash.) Tj
T* (2. Distributor fulfill with insufficient stock -> should reject transition.) Tj
T* (3. Manufacturer dispatch with insufficient stock -> should reject transition.) Tj
T* (4. Seller receive before `OnTheWayToSeller` -> should reject.) Tj
T* (5. Seller receive after `OnTheWayToSeller` -> should update seller inventory.) Tj
T* (6. Distributor receive before `OnTheWayToDistributor` -> should reject.) Tj
T* (7. Distributor receive after `OnTheWayToDistributor` -> should update distributor inventory.) Tj
T* (8. Invalid role on incoming/outgoing endpoints -> should return `400`.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### 3.4 What to include in your report/demo) Tj
T* (- Test matrix with expected vs actual results.) Tj
T* (- Screenshots of successful and failed validation paths.) Tj
T* (- Bug history \(issue -> root cause -> fix -> retest\).) Tj
T* (- Coverage note: what is tested and what is not.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (---) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 4\) Suitable Deployment Techniques \(LO4\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### 4.1 Option A: Traditional Windows Server + IIS + SQL Server) Tj
T* (**Use when:** simple academic deployment and low ops complexity.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Pros:**) Tj
T* (- Easy for ASP.NET MVC/Web API projects.) Tj
T* (- Familiar setup for .NET Framework projects.) Tj
ET
